<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0580_T24R0801_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I can’t remember the last time\nsomebody came to see me. My kids don’t\fcall.\rBack in my day I was a Hustler. I tried\nto reach the tower and dive the ocean.\rI put work into a LOTTA things. Now I\njust sit here, listenin’ to the\fwaves and waitin’ on a phone call.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0580_T24R0801_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You heard of the Bell Tower in\nEcruteak?\rThere’s Clear Bells at the top. They\ndon’t make a sound, even in wind.\rOnly one way to ring ’em.\rYou gotta get another Clear Bell just\nlike ’em.\fI chased it my whole youth.\fNever got one. Got a divorce instead.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0580_T24R0801_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You heard of the Whirl Islands?\rThere’s Tidal Bells in the waterfall\nbasin. They don’t make a sound, even in\fwaves.\rOnly one way to ring ’em.\rGet another Tidal Bell just like ’em.\fI chased it my whole youth.\fNever got one. Got arthritis instead.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0580_T24R0801_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh! You got a Clear Bell?\rMy old dream...\nI see...\fYou did it...\r...\n...I can hear it!\rThe bells chimin’ on the wind\ncomin’ from the direction of\fthe Bell Tower...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0580_T24R0801_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh! You got a Tidal Bell?\rMy old dream...\nI see...\fYou did it...\r...\n...I can hear it!\rThe bells chimin’ on the sea\nbreeze comin’ from the direction of\fthe Whirl Islands...</language>
	</row>
</body>
